<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian forces rescued 24 soldiers held by armed groups in the Kidal region and received Mi-24 and Mi-8 helicopters and an Il-76 transport, while three UN peacekeepers were killed in northern Mali. In Burkina Faso, the junta is targeting critics abroad and France is in contact with local authorities after an attack, advising its citizens to avoid the area. Nigeria reported a truck crash in Niger state that killed 14 people, and Islamist militants killed at least 14 Christians in Plateau State. The rivalry between al-Qaeda and ISIS is intensifying across the Sahel. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8yeGdBMXZQeHdkUUZ0UGlvRVM2LWtzTXpNaGVPT0JuYW1FWVZXUVZxall0S2hkcG1makZxUHp2aS1SNXNET0s2T3FTVXZFX2hoc1B2ZHVCMHlrRVc5THfSAWNBVV95cUxQbXZTdmkzWXpxci1iTDhkV3I1ZFVSNEtwM0pSbVMyRWxNUVlxM1RkSHRkRzZRWWtuNnU3RFVXenhmamtxNlZRX2VrYjVhX1F5SVNOWU5kVWg3bHFNeWF0TmxIQ0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;la Repubblica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOUWhTYXV6NGNCYXJqQVc0c2VRQW5VZ2tJeHp6aEVENWdPdjBYckRkbWlmcXFvNGlQdUlPSmdsSy1tcklJNDNNeHoybmRBaFVEckUxblVVYk5LV2ZZaldtUHQ5Z2kyOEpuYjdQRTRwWlBoRnNrU2JzWWlEclhaaXE5M0I1Mm5lRUc5WEVEX0JvZVpSMTltcTBVbVB3dzl3c1JzMlJ1V01LMndmZUpkd0JTTUFHc3h1UWZMVjRsckFhNGxpU1pQRHR5aA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Moscow Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTS1LSGlyR0FqZUpPSFQwME9xWWtfd0QwaVlzckY3eVBnR1lqQXdSUm14VjMwYVI3WXIxRXRMUm0xVTFVOVU3MG05SGJITjBCd2pDaXFPUDE4RzhOQ21qcGZySmhxSHEzM2NkdW1ZTDViYnRvSEJJZVBVTWp6cVNEQkJlR3VNN3hRT3Q1M0w3RWt6R2NvaEhPaUk0blllNWZzZ2Z4MlBkTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Barnabas Aid&lt;